{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54136","headline":"送友人北游 · 张乔","name":"送友人北游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东归未遂心，北去几沉吟。\n把酒思乡远，投文入塞深。\n晋山擎白道，汾水截青林。\n想见连天雪，安知（一作「长安」）是积霖。\n（见《文苑英华》卷二八三、《唐音统签》卷六四九《戊签》六四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54136.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54136","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}